OL,3,GNEWSAThe rapist priest who abused his
OL,4,A'cult-like' congregation
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the detailed written instructions
OL,7,Fgiven to the young women who worked
OL,8,Fwithout pay in the then-Reverend Chris
OL,9,FBrain's house, there was a revealing
OL,10,Fdemand.
OL,12,FThe homebase team, as they were known,
OL,13,Fwere to "do anything" the Church of
OL,14,FEngland priest asked of them.
OL,16,FRoutine tasks - assigned on a rota 24
OL,17,Fhours a day, seven days a week -
OL,18,Fincluded cooking, cleaning, ironing,
OL,19,Fshopping, looking after Brain's young
OL,20,Fdaughter, and walking his dog.
