OL,3,GNEWSAThe rapist priest who abused his
OL,4,A'cult-like' congregation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis housework was intended to free
OL,7,FBrain for his mission of leading the
OL,8,FNine O'Clock Service (NOS), a radical
OL,9,Fcongregation of hundreds of young
OL,10,Fpeople drawn weekly to a Sheffield
OL,11,Fchurch in the 1980s and 1990s by a
OL,12,Ffusion of rave culture, live music,
OL,13,Fenvironmental activism and liturgy.
